  "headline": "ChatGPT desktop reads on-screen IDE content while Cursor edits \u2014 high data-leakage and prompt-injection paths.",
  "sub_verdicts": {
    "A_prompt_injection": {
      "severity": "high",
      "rationale": "ChatGPT Work-with-Apps can read VS Code / IDEs; copying its suggestions into Cursor's chat makes it the next planning input. Cursor's Agent then acts on attacker-influenced text from web search ChatGPT did. The bridge is screen + clipboard.",
